@SapaFoRestRMSAPI_HostAddress = https://localhost:7096

GET {{SapaFoRestRMSAPI_HostAddress}}/weatherforecast/
Accept: application/json

###

# ==================== AUTHENTICATION ====================

### Owner Login
POST {{SapaFoRestRMSAPI_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "owner@sapforest.com",
  "password": "Owner123!"
}

