# ==================== REVENUE FILTER API ====================

### Test Revenue Filter API (Owner Role Required)
POST {{SapaFoRestRMSAPI_HostAddress}}/api/owner/revenue/filter
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{owner_token}}

{
  "startDate": "2025-12-9T10:22:53.472Z",
  "endDate": "2025-12-19T10:22:53.472Z",
  "branchName": "string",
  "paymentMethod": "string"
}

